  "notes": "FORMS:\n{復|ふく} (restore, return) + {号|ごう} (code, signal) → restoring from code\n{復号|ふくごう}する (to decrypt, to decode)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{暗号化|あんごうか} (encryption)\n\nTECHNICAL TERMS:\n- {復号|ふくごう}{鍵|かぎ} (decryption key)\n- {復号化|ふくごうか} (decryption - alternative form)\n- {復号|ふくごう}アルゴリズム (decryption algorithm)\n\nPROCESS:\n{暗号化|あんごうか} (encryption) ↔ {復号|ふくごう} (decryption)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {暗号|あんごう} (cipher, code)\n- {暗号化|あんごうか} (encryption)\n- {解読|かいどく} (deciphering, breaking a code)",
